@* The trigger is `absolute inset-0`: an invisible sheet over the whole card, not a wrapper
   around it. Nest the media and the text inside and they position absolutely too and escape the
   card. Its own content should be a name and nothing else, because a link with no text is
   announced as its own URL. *@
<div class="flex w-[320px] flex-col gap-3">
    <Attachment>
        <AttachmentMedia><Icon Name="file" /></AttachmentMedia>
        <AttachmentContent>
            <AttachmentTitle>acme-msa.pdf</AttachmentTitle>
            <AttachmentDescription>Opens in a tab</AttachmentDescription>
        </AttachmentContent>
        <AttachmentTrigger Href="/files/acme-msa.pdf">
            <span class="sr-only">Open acme-msa.pdf</span>
        </AttachmentTrigger>
    </Attachment>

    <Attachment>
        <AttachmentMedia><Icon Name="file" /></AttachmentMedia>
        <AttachmentContent>
            <AttachmentTitle>draft.md</AttachmentTitle>
            <AttachmentDescription>A button, for something that is not a URL</AttachmentDescription>
        </AttachmentContent>
        <AttachmentTrigger><span class="sr-only">Preview draft.md</span></AttachmentTrigger>
    </Attachment>
</div>
